{"id":"663964","name":"猪肚鸡","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/663964/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"新鲜猪肚","amount":"一个"},{"name":"鸡","amount":"半只"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"醋","amount":"少许"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"莲子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"党参","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白酒","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜的猪肚，加盐、醋、面粉，抓拌均匀，彻底清洗干净。","img":"images/663964/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加葱、姜片，少许白酒煮10分钟，捞出，过凉水清洗干净。","img":"images/663964/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪肚切成小段，备用。","img":"images/663964/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅凉油，转中小火，下入姜片和稍多的胡椒粒炒出香味。","img":"images/663964/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下入猪肚。","img":"images/663964/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/663964/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入开水，大火煮开。","img":"images/663964/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"转入砂锅中。","img":"images/663964/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开，转中小火，盖上锅盖炖煮30分钟后。","img":"images/663964/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"分钟后，加入鸡块。","img":"images/663964/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入红枣、莲子(提前泡发)，党参。","img":"images/663964/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盖上盖子，再炖煮25分钟左右。","img":"images/663964/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"时间结束后，加胡椒粉(稍多)，盐和鸡精调味。","img":"images/663964/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/663964/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"暖心又暖胃，请品尝！","img":"images/663964/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}